<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT#"
     xml:base="https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:eudpp="https://w3id.org/eudpp#"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT">
        <terms:contributor xml:lang="en">Riina Maigre</terms:contributor>
        <terms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-04-13</terms:created>
        <terms:creator xml:lang="en">Tarmo Robal</terms:creator>
        <terms:description xml:lang="en">MODULE: IDENT
Identifier module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.

The Identifier module proposes an universal approach for identifiers used in the EU DPP CO delivered by the CIRPASS-2 European Project.  
The module describes identifiers used for the project through aspects and scheme references, if appropriate, granularity is added.
---

DESIGN RESTRICTION: Specific modules of the EU DPP CO need to use the Connector to establish a link to the Identifiers module. The link needs to be establsihed to a subclass of aIdentifier class, e.g., Product hasUniqueProductIdentifier ProductIdentifier.
---

DEPENDENCIES: This module may have dependencies to all  EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules that use different types of identifiers, including: CON, P_DPP, SOC, ACTOR, ...  
--

THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. 
All liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user.</terms:description>
        <terms:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-22</terms:issued>
        <terms:license rdf:resource="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"/>
        <terms:license xml:lang="en">This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. 
In case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).</terms:license>
        <terms:title xml:lang="en">The Identifier (IDENT) module of the EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project.</terms:title>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>ident</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">First iteration of the Identifier module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EU DPP IDENT</rdfs:label>
        <owl:versionInfo>1.0.7</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


